From 94b11a69fb9e4eb9340d811d06d7facbe6850742 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eric Angleton <1669072+angleton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Sep 2026 13:44:44 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Add IPsec ESP, IKEv2, and X.509 certificate identity
 diagnosis

- diagnosis.rs: recognize ESP traffic (SPI/sequence from clear-text header),
  IKE handshakes on UDP 500/4500 (exchange type, SPIs), and resolve PKI-backed
  peer identity from an IKE Certificate payload via x509-parser
- fixtures.rs: add esp_traffic, ike_sa_init, and ike_auth_with_certificate
  fixtures; the certificate fixture embeds a real self-signed X.509 DER
  generated via examples/gen_ike_cert.rs (rcgen)
- diagnosis.feature/cucumber.rs: add BDD scenarios and step definitions for
  the new ESP/IKE/certificate diagnoses (spi, certificate subject checks)
- Cargo.toml: add x509-parser (runtime) and rcgen (dev) dependencies
